{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01EDzPiZxZsFsDxWzGFkpHqx", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_Pablo_Machado\"}, {\"url\": \"https://kzsc.org/blog/2021/11/27/who-is-the-lofi-girl/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://edgeworkscreative.com/blog/friday-props-machado\"}, {\"url\": \"https://uproxx.com/music/who-is-behind-lofi-girl/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://magazine.shots.net/news/view/juan-pablo-machado-joins-passion-paris\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.nssmag.com/it/lifestyle/30376/lofi-girl\"}, {\"url\": \"https://mezha.net/eng/bukvy/lofi-girl-has-graduated-the-story-and-impact-of-the-popular-youtube-channel/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://class101.net/en/products/5f3a49042d8c93000c3ec25a\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.everybodywiki.com/Juan_Pablo_Machado\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:04:41.807Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Lofi Girl illustrator Colombian Juan Pablo Machado", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01D4XoNdnPz6jb3QUGzUETXs", "content": [{"title": "Juan Pablo Machado", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_Pablo_Machado"}, {"title": "who is the lofi girl", "url": "https://kzsc.org/blog/2021/11/27/who-is-the-lofi-girl/"}, {"title": "friday props machado", "url": "https://edgeworkscreative.com/blog/friday-props-machado"}, {"title": "Who Is The Person Behind Lofi Girl?", "url": "https://uproxx.com/music/who-is-behind-lofi-girl/"}, {"title": "juan pablo machado joins passion paris", "url": "https://magazine.shots.net/news/view/juan-pablo-machado-joins-passion-paris"}, {"title": "lofi girl", "url": "https://www.nssmag.com/it/lifestyle/30376/lofi-girl"}, {"title": "Lofi Girl has graduated: the story and impact of the popular YouTube channel", "url": "https://mezha.net/eng/bukvy/lofi-girl-has-graduated-the-story-and-impact-of-the-popular-youtube-channel/"}, {"title": "class101.net", "url": "https://class101.net/en/products/5f3a49042d8c93000c3ec25a"}, {"title": "Juan Pablo Machado", "url": "https://en.everybodywiki.com/Juan_Pablo_Machado"}]}, "Juan Pablo Machado is a Colombian-French artist best known for creating Lofi Girl, the character on the lofi music channel now called Lofi Girl.\n\n- **Background:** He is originally from Cali, Colombia, and after a stint at an art school in Bogotá, he moved to Lyon in 2013 to study at the École Émile-Cohl.\n- **How the character came about:** The channel had lost its earlier Studio Ghibli-based image to copyright takedowns, so it put out a call for artists at his school. He answered it while still a student, and his sketches were accepted as the new design.\n- **Design details:** The character is named Jade, and Machado later decided to set the character's iconic room in La Croix-Rousse in Lyon, France, which can be seen through her window. The lighting also changes based on the time; sunrise, daytime, sunset, and nighttime.\n- **Later work:** He has worked as an animator and storyboard artist. One source says he worked for Studio La Cachette in France as an animator and also make freelance animated visuals. He also joined the roster of Passion Paris as an artist and director.\n\nSources differ slightly on details. One says the channel name was changed to Lofi Girl in March 2021, while another gives the illustration date as September 2018, so the exact timeline is not fully settled."], "durationSeconds": 5.525354708999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01EDzPiZxZsFsDxWzGFkpHqx", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
